<title>UK: LONDON GOLD FIXES FIRMER, NEARS RESISTANCE.</title>
<headline>LONDON GOLD FIXES FIRMER, NEARS RESISTANCE.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $327.70 vs $326.20 previously. Higher since New York opening. Focus on forex, Dow, bond markets for further falls. Selling forecast at $328.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Touch firmer with gold at $4.43/$4.45, up three cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up $2.00 at $444.00/$447.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Firmer by $1.50 at $234.25/$237.25.</p>
</text>
